en being attacked, but they must be hearing things.","abilities":["Bounces <'Certain Fates'>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":3800,"def":1500,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":7}},"kouhei_mifune":{"slug":"kouhei_mifune","name":"Kouhei Mifune","icon":"/enemies-icons/Kouhei Mifune.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"His sword speaks not of honor or loyalty, only the obsession to cut away all obstacles in the way of the tide, even if he himself is destined to become a nameless bubble within before the end.","abilities":["First Form","None","[Garyui Iai - Issen] Immediately moves a certain distance towards the next checkpoint when blocked","ATK and DEF increase as HP drops","The first time HP drops to 0, enters second form and casts [Manipulate Opinion]","[Manipulate Opinion] Removes all 'Favor' and stops current 'Lucksack'","Second Form","[Garyui Iai - Ketsujin] Immediately moves a certain distance towards the next checkpoint when blocked; recovers all SP when the blocked unit is defeated or retreats","[Canvas of Strategy] Periodically gains a 'Zan'","Attacks deal damage one more time for every 'Zan' possessed","ATK and DEF increase as HP drops"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.35,"stats":{"hp":110000,"atk":1500,"def":1000,"res":70,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"certain_fates_enemy_10111_ymgpck":{"slug":"certain_fates_enemy_10111_ymgpck","name":"'Certain Fates'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Certain Fates'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"The size of a fingertip, the weight of a murmur of fate and inertia. It does not intend to destroy, not even to arrive. It only follows the shortest path of inevitability